      <title>Ongoing lawsuits allege GLP-1s can cause serious harm. But we don't know how often</title>
      <author>Yuki Noguchi</author>
      <link>https://www.npr.org/2026/10/10/nx-s1-5996652/glp1-fda-naion-blind-lawsuit-ozempic</link>
