      <title>After losing ground with Latino voters, Democrats are turning to influencers for help</title>
      <author>Claudia Grisales</author>
      <link>https://www.npr.org/2026/10/10/nx-s1-5991897/democrats-latino-voters-influencers-bold-pac</link>
